sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Usuario
    participant UI as Compose Store (Pinia)
    participant SQLite as Local Storage (Mutations)
    participant Runner as Outbox Runner (Worker)
    participant Server as Servidor JMAP

    User->>UI: Clic en "Enviar"
    UI->>SQLite: insertPendingMutation(type: SEND, data: JSON)
    SQLite-->>UI: OK (mutación encolada)
    UI-->>User: Cierra composer (Enviado optimista)
    
    SQLite-->>Runner: Notifica nueva mutación
    Runner->>Runner: Extrae imágenes inline (data: URL)
    
    opt Imágenes Inline
        Runner->>Server: Blob/upload
        Server-->>Runner: Blob IDs
        Runner->>Runner: Reemplaza src por cid: en HTML
    end
    
    Runner->>Server: JMAP Batch Call
    Note right of Runner: 1. Email/set (Create #c1 en Outbox)<br/>2. EmailSubmission/set (Send #c1)<br/>3. onSuccessUpdateEmail (Mover a Sent, quitar $draft)
    
    Server-->>Runner: OK (Id del email real)
    Runner->>SQLite: Borrar mutación pendiente
    Runner->>SQLite: Sincronizar carpeta Sent (Reflejar cambio)
